    <p class="legal-doc-meta">Last updated: 2026 · JobSeen by Arigato Labs</p>

    <h2>1. Agreement</h2>
    <p>
      By using <strong>JobSeen</strong>, you agree to these Terms. If you do not agree, do not use the app.
    </p>

    <h2>2. The service</h2>
    <p>
      JobSeen is provided by <strong>Arigato Labs</strong> as a personal job-tracking and related collaboration tool
      (applications, call leads, routes, connections, and messaging as offered in the product).
    </p>

    <h2>3. Accounts</h2>
    <p>
      You are responsible for your Google login, username, and all content you add (jobs, leads, messages, etc.).
      Keep your account secure and do not share access with others.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Acceptable use</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>No abuse, harassment, or illegal content.</li>
      <li>No scraping or automation that harms the service or other users.</li>
      <li>No attempts to bypass security, permissions, or One Password protections.</li>
      <li>Respect others’ listings — copy only when they grant permission.</li>
    </ul>

