    <h2>6. Availability</h2>
    <p>
      The service may change, break, or stop at any time. We do not guarantee uptime, sync speed, or that every feature will remain available.
    </p>

    <h2>7. Termination</h2>
    <p>
      We may suspend or restrict access for abuse or security risk. You may stop using JobSeen at any time.
    </p>

    <h2>8. Governing note</h2>
    <p>
      Disputes are handled under applicable law in the founder’s jurisdiction (India), unless later specified otherwise.
    </p>

    <h2>9. Contact</h2>
    <p>
      <a href="mailto:kumardevanshu3001@gmail.com">kumardevanshu3001@gmail.com</a>
      · <a href="/contact">Contact form</a>
    </p>

    <footer class="legal-doc-footer">
      <ArigatoLegalLinks client:load />
      <p>Copyright &copy; 2026 Arigato Labs. All Rights Reserved.</p>
      <p>Built by Kumar Devanshu.</p>
    </footer>
  </article>
</AppLayout>
